B.a9u=s(["I have sailed the River of Yellow Flowers,","Borne by the channel of a green stream,","Rounding ten thousand turns through the mountains","On a journey of less than thirty miles....","Rapids hum over heaped rocks;","But where light grows dim in the thick pines,","The surface of an inlet sways with nut-horns","And weeds are lush along the banks.","...Down in my heart I have always been as pure","As this limpid water is....","Oh, to remain on a broad flat rock","And to cast a fishing-line forever!"],t.s)
