B.aeo=s(["In the slant of the sun on the country-side,","Cattle and sheep trail home along the lane;","And a rugged old man in a thatch door","Leans on a staff and thinks of his son, the herdboy.","There are whirring pheasants? full wheat-ears,","Silk-worms asleep, pared mulberry-leaves.","And the farmers, returning with hoes on their shoulders,","Hail one another familiarly.","...No wonder I long for the simple life","And am sighing the old song, Oh, to go Back Again!"],t.s)
