B.abg=s(["Lying on a high seat in the south study,","We have lifted the curtain-and we see the rising moon","Brighten with pure light the water and the grove","And flow like a wave on our window and our door.","It will move through the cycle, full moon and then crescent again,","Calmly, beyond our wisdom, altering new to old.","...Our chosen one, our friend, is now by a limpid river --","Singing, perhaps, a plaintive eastern song.","He is far, far away from us, three hundred miles away.","And yet a breath of orchids comes along the wind."],t.s)
