B.a2l=s(["To your hermitage here on the top of the mountain","I have climbed, without stopping, these ten miles.","I have knocked at your door, and no one answered;","I have peeped into your room, at your seat beside the table.","Perhaps you are out riding in your canopied chair,","Or fishing, more likely, in some autumn pool.","Sorry though I am to be missing you,","You have become my meditation --","The beauty of your grasses, fresh with rain,","And close beside your window the music of your pines.","I take into my being all that I see and hear,","Soothing my senses, quieting my heart;","And though there be neither host nor guest,","Have I not reasoned a visit complete?","...After enough, I have gone down the mountain.","Why should I wait for you any longer?"],t.s)
