B.ad9=s(["Thoughtful elation has no end:","Onward I bear it to whatever come.","And my boat and I, before the evening breeze","Passing flowers, entering the lake,","Turn at nightfall toward the western valley,","Where I watch the south star over the mountain","And a mist that rises, hovering soft,","And the low moon slanting through the trees;","And I choose to put away from me every worldly matter","And only to be an old man with a fishing-pole."],t.s)
