B.a1y=s(["Wistful, away from my friends and kin,","Through mist and fog I float and float","With the sail that bears me toward Loyang.","In Yangzhou trees linger bell-notes of evening,","Marking the day and the place of our parting....","When shall we meet again and where?","...Destiny is a boat on the waves,","Borne to and fro, beyond our will."],t.s)
