B.a_I=s(["I had so long been troubled by official hat and robe","That I am glad to be an exile here in this wild southland.","I am a neighbour now of planters and reapers.","I am a guest of the mountains and woods.","I plough in the morning, turning dewy grasses,","And at evening tie my fisher-boat, breaking the quiet stream.","Back and forth I go, scarcely meeting anyone,","And sing a long poem and gaze at the blue sky."],t.s)
