B.Ms=s(["Drink, my horse, while we cross the autumn water!-","The stream is cold and the wind like a sword,","As we watch against the sunset on the sandy plain,","Far, far away, shadowy Lingtao.","Old battles, waged by those long walls,","Once were proud on all men's tongues.","But antiquity now is a yellow dust,","Confusing in the grasses its ruins and white bones."],t.s)
