B.ari=s(["There once was a man, sent on military missions,","A wanderer, from youth, on the You and Yan frontiers.","Under the horses' hoofs he would meet his foes","And, recklessly risking his seven-foot body,","Would slay whoever dared confront","Those moustaches that bristled like porcupinequills.","...There were dark clouds below the hills, there were white clouds above them,","But before a man has served full time, how can he go back?","In eastern Liao a girl was waiting, a girl of fifteen years,","Deft with a guitar, expert in dance and song.","...She seems to be fluting, even now, a reed-song of home,","Filling every soldier's eyes with homesick tears."],t.s)
