B.Na=s(["Stone-Fish Lake is like Lake Dongting --","When the top of Zun is green and the summer tide is rising.","...With the mountain for a table, and the lake a fount of wine,","The tipplers all are settled along the sandy shore.","Though a stiff wind for days has roughened the water,","Wine-boats constantly arrive....","I have a long-necked gourd and, happy on Ba Island,","I am pouring a drink in every direction doing away with care."],t.s)
