B.aiN=s(["An old fisherman spent the night here, under the western cliff;","He dipped up water from the pure Hsiang and made a bamboo fire;","And then, at sunrise, he went his way through the cloven mist,","With only the creak of his paddle left, in the greenness of mountain and river.","...I turn and see the waves moving as from heaven,","And clouds above the cliffs coming idly, one by one."],t.s)
