B.aqm=s(['"I am endlessly yearning',"To be in Changan.","...Insects hum of autumn by the gold brim of the well;","A thin frost glistens like little mirrors on my cold mat;","The high lantern flickers; and. deeper grows my longing.","I lift the shade and, with many a sigh, gaze upon the moon,","Single as a flower, centred from the clouds.","Above, I see the blueness and deepness of sky.","Below, I see the greenness and the restlessness of water....","Heaven is high, earth wide; bitter between them flies my sorrow.","Can I dream through the gateway, over the mountain?","Endless longing",'Breaks my heart."'],t.s)
