B.a6j=s(["The moon, grown full now over the sea,","Brightening the whole of heaven,","Brings to separated hearts","The long thoughtfulness of night....","It is no darker though I blow out my candle.","It is no warmer though I put on my coat.","So I leave my message with the moon","And turn to my  bed, hoping for dreams."],t.s)
