B.am5=s(["In the pure morning, near the old temple,","Where early sunlight points the tree-tops,","My path has wound, through a sheltered hollow","Of boughs and flowers, to a Buddhist retreat.","Here birds are alive with mountain-light,","And the mind of man touches peace in a pool,","And a thousand sounds are quieted","By the breathing of a temple-bell."],t.s)
