B.aov=s(["Master, I hail you from my heart,","And your fame arisen to the skies....","Renouncing in ruddy youth the importance of hat and chariot,","You chose pine-trees and clouds; and now, whitehaired,","Drunk with the moon, a sage of dreams,","Flower-bewitched, you are deaf to the Emperor....","High mountain, how I long to reach you,","Breathing your sweetness even here!"],t.s)
