B.U8=s(["Sailing far off from Jingmen Ferry,","Soon you will be with people in the south,","Where the mountains end and the plains begin","And the river winds through wilderness....","The moon is lifted like a mirror,","Sea-clouds gleam like palaces,","And the water has brought you a touch of home","To draw your boat three hundred miles."],t.s)
