B.abQ=s(["With a blue line of mountains north of the wall,","And east of the city a white curve of water,","Here you must leave me and drift away","Like a loosened water-plant hundreds of miles....","I shall think of you in a floating cloud;","So in the sunset think of me.","...We wave our hands to say good-bye,","And my horse is neighing again and again."],t.s)
