B.a7q=s(["The monk from Shu with his green silk lute-case,","Walking west down Omei Mountain,","Has brought me by one touch of the strings","The breath of pines in a thousand valleys.","I hear him in the cleansing brook,","I hear him in the icy bells;","And I feel no change though the mountain darken","And cloudy autumn heaps the sky."],t.s)
