B.Yx=s(["This night to the west of the river-brim","There is not one cloud in the whole blue sky,","As I watch from my deck the autumn moon,","Vainly remembering old General Xie....","I have poems; I can read;","He heard others, but not mine.","...Tomorrow I shall hoist my sail,","With fallen maple-leaves behind me."],t.s)
