B.UU=s(["Far off in Fuzhou she is watching the moonlight,","Watching it alone from the window of her chamber-","For our boy and girl, poor little babes,","Are too young to know where the Capital is.","Her cloudy hair is sweet with mist,","Her jade-white shoulder is cold in the moon.","...When shall we lie again, with no more tears,","Watching this bright light on our screen?"],t.s)
