B.a6D=s(["Flowers are shadowed, the palace darkens,","Birds twitter by for a place to perch;","Heaven's ten thousand windows are twinkling,","And nine cloud-terraces are gleaming in the moonlight.","...While I wait for the golden lock to turn,","I hear jade pendants tinkling in the wind....","I have a petition to present in the morning,","All night I ask what time it is."],t.s)
