B.ahd=s(["This is the road by which I fled,","When the rebels had reached the west end of the city;","And terror, ever since, has clutched at my vitals","Lest some of my soul should never return.","...The court has come back now, filling the capital;","But the Emperor sends me away again.","Useless and old, I rein in my horse","For one last look at the thousand gates."],t.s)
