B.TZ=s(["This is where your comrade must leave you,","Turning at the foot of these purple mountains....","When shall we lift our cups again, I wonder,","As we did last night and walk in the moon?","The region is murmuring farewell","To one who was honoured through three reigns;","And back I go now to my river-village,","Into the final solitude."],t.s)
