B.arh=s(["Having to travel back now from this far place,","I dismount beside your lonely tomb.","The ground where I stand is wet with my tears;","The sky is dark with broken clouds....","I who played chess with the great Premier","Am bringing to my lord the dagger he desired.","But I find only petals falling down,","I hear only linnets answering."],t.s)
