B.a0v=s(["Not knowing the way to the Temple of Heaped Fragrance,","Under miles of mountain-cloud I have wandered","Through ancient woods without a human track;","But now on the height I hear a bell.","A rillet sings over winding rocks,","The sun is tempered by green pines....","And at twilight, close to an emptying pool,","Thought can conquer the Passion-Dragon."],t.s)
