B.XE=s(["My heart in middle age found the Way.","And I came to dwell at the foot of this mountain.","When the spirit moves, I wander alone","Amid beauty that is all for me....","I will walk till the water checks my path,","Then sit and watch the rising clouds --","And some day meet an old wood-cutter","And talk and laugh and never return."],t.s)
