B.apK=s(["Here in the Eighth-month the waters of the lake","Are of a single air with heaven,","And a mist from the Yun and Meng valleys","Has beleaguered the city of Youzhou.","I should like to cross, but I can find no boat.","...How ashamed I am to be idler than you statesmen,","As I sit here and watch a fisherman casting","And emptily envy him his catch."],t.s)
