B.W1=s(["While worldly matters take their turn,","Ancient, modern, to and fro,","Rivers and mountains are changeless in their glory","And still to be witnessed from this trail.","Where a fisher-boat dips by a waterfall,","Where the air grows colder, deep in the valley,","The monument of Yang remains;","And we have wept, reading the words."],t.s)
