B.a4X=s(["Toward a mist upon the water","Still I wave my hand and sob,","For the flying bird is lost in space","Beyond a desolate green mountain....","But now the long river, the far lone sail,","five lakes, gleam like spring in the sunset;","And down an island white with duckweed","Comes the quiet of communion."],t.s)
