B.a4J=s(["Walking along a little path,","I find a footprint on the moss,","A while cloud low on the quiet lake,","Grasses that sweeten an idle door,","A pine grown greener with the rain,","A brook that comes from a mountain source --","And, mingling with Truth among the flowers,","I have forgotten what to say."],t.s)
