B.ahO=s(["New Year's only deepens my longing,","Adds to the lonely tears of an exile","Who, growing old and still in harness,","Is left here by the homing spring....","Monkeys come down from the mountains to haunt me.","I bend like a willow, when it rains on the river.","I think of Jia Yi, who taught here and died here-","And I wonder what my term shall be."],t.s)
