B.ant=s(["Is it raining on the river all the way to Chu? -- -","The evening bell comes to us from Nanjing.","Your wet sail drags and is loath to be going","And shadowy birds are flying slow.","We cannot see the deep ocean-gate --","Only the boughs at Pukou, newly dripping.","Likewise, because of our great love,","There are threads of water on our faces."],t.s)
