B.a6G=s(["While a cold wind is creeping under my mat,","And the city's naked wall grows pale with the autumn moon,","I see a lone wild-goose crossing the River of Stars,","And I hear, on stone in the night, thousands of washing mallets....","But, instead of wishing the season, as it goes,","To bear me also far away,","I have found your poem so beautiful","That I forget the homing birds."],t.s)
