B.a0j=s(["On a road outreaching the white clouds,","By a spring outrunning the bluest river,","Petals come drifting on the wind","And the brook is sweet with them all the way.","My quiet gate is a mountain-trail,","And the willow-trees about my cottage","Sift on my sleeve, through the shadowy noon,","Distillations of the sun."],t.s)
