B.ale=s(["While the autumn moon is pouring full","On a thousand night-levels among towns and villages,","There meet by chance, south of the river,","Dreaming doubters of a dream....","In the trees a wind has startled the birds,","And insects cower from cold in the grass;","But wayfarers at least have wine","And nothing to fear -- till the morning bell."],t.s)
