B.ak9=s(["By my old gate, among yellow grasses,","Still we linger, sick at heart.","The way you must follow through cold clouds","Will lead you this evening into snow.","Your father died; you left home young;","Nobody knew of your misfortunes.","We cry, we say nothing. What can I wish you,","In this blowing wintry world?"],t.s)
