B.afn=s(["After these ten torn wearisome years","We have met again. We were both so changed","That hearing first your surname, I thought you a stranger --","Then hearing your given name, I remembered your young face....","All that has happened with the tides","We have told and told till the evening bell....","Tomorrow you journey to Youzhou,","Leaving autumn between us, peak after peak."],t.s)
