B.agf=s(["Long divided by river and sea,","For years we two have failed to meet --","And suddenly to find you seems like a dream....","With a catch in the throat, we ask how old we are.","...Our single lamp shines, through cold and wet,","On a bamboo-thicket sheathed in rain;","But forgetting the sadness that will come with tomorrow,","Let us share the comfort of this farewell wine."],t.s)
