B.RJ=s(["Even in this world the spirit of a hero","Lives and reigns for thousands of years.","You were the firmest of the pot's three legs;","It was you who maintained the honour of the currency;","You chose a great premier to magnify your kingdom....","And yet you had a son so little like his father","That girls of your country were taken captive","To dance in the palace of the King of Wei."],t.s)
