B.ap1=s(["Last year you went with your troops to Yuezhi;","And when your men had vanished beyond the citywall,","News was cut off  between the two worlds","As between the living and the dead.","No one has come upon a faithful horse guarding","A crumpled tent or torn flag, or any trace of you.","If only I knew, I might serve you in the temple,","Instead of these tears toward the far sky."],t.s)
