B.aq1=s(["Solitary at the tavern,","I am shut in with loneliness and grief.","Under the cold lamp, I brood on the past;","I am kept awake by a lost wildgoose.","...Roused at dawn from a misty dream,","I read, a year late, news from home --","And I remember the moon like smoke on the river","And a fisher-boat moored there, under my door."],t.s)
