B.a84=s(["Red leaves are fluttering down the twilight","Past this arbour where I take my wine;","Cloud-rifts are blowing toward Great Flower Mountain,","And a shower is crossing the Middle Ridge.","I can see trees colouring a distant wall.","I can hear the river seeking the sea,","As I the Imperial City tomorrow --","But I dream of woodsmen and fishermen."],t.s)
