B.Mb=s(["There's a harp in the midnight playing clear,","While the west wind rustles a green vine;","There's a low cloud touching the jade-white dew","And an early wildgoose in the River of Stars....","Night in the tall trees clings to dawn;","Light makes folds in the distant hills;","And here on the Huai, by one falling leaf,","I can feel a storm on Lake Dongting."],t.s)
