B.a4p=s(["Pure of heart and therefore hungry,","All night long you have sung in vain --","Oh, this final broken indrawn breath","Among the green indifferent trees!","Yes, I have gone like a piece of driftwood,","I have let my garden fill with weeds....","I bless you for your true advice","To live as pure a life as yours."],t.s)
