B.NH=s(["I ponder on the poem of The Precious Dagger.","My road has wound through many years.","...Now yellow leaves are shaken with a gale;","Yet piping and fiddling keep the Blue Houses merry.","On the surface, I seem to be glad of new people;","But doomed to leave old friends behind me,","I cry out from my heart for Xinfeng wine","To melt away my thousand woes."],t.s)
