B.amm=s(["Gone is the guest from the Chamber of Rank,","And petals, confused in my little garden,","Zigzagging down my crooked path,","Escort like dancers the setting sun.","Oh, how can I bear to sweep them away?","To a sad-eyed watcher they never return.","Heart's fragrance is spent with the ending of spring","And nothing left but a tear-stained robe."],t.s)
