B.Ww=s(["You are gone. The river is high at my door.","Cicadas are mute on dew-laden boughs.","This is a moment when thoughts enter deep.","I stand alone for a long while.","...The North Star is nearer to me now than spring,","And couriers from your southland never arrive --","Yet I doubt my dream on the far horizon","That you have found another friend."],t.s)
