B.aen=s(["Where the sun has entered the western hills,","I look for a monk in his little straw hut;","But only the fallen leaves are at home,","And I turn through chilling levels of cloud","I hear a stone gong in the dusk,","I lean full-weight on my slender staff","How within this world, within this grain of dust,","Can there be any room for the passions of men?"],t.s)
