B.a2Q=s(["After the shower at Bashang,","I see an evening line of wildgeese,","The limp-hanging leaves of a foreign tree,","A lantern's cold gleam, lonely in the night,","An empty garden, white with dew,","The ruined wall of a neighbouring monastery.","...I have taken my ease here long enough.","What am I waiting for, I wonder."],t.s)
