B.aaf=s(["Though a bugle breaks the crystal air of autumn,","Soldiers, in the look-out, watch at ease today","The spring wind blowing across green graves","And the pale sun setting beyond Liangzhou.","For now, on grey plains done with war,","The border is open to travel again;","And Tartars can no more choose than rivers:","They are running, all of them, toward the south."],t.s)
