B.a2P=s(["Farther and farther from the three Ba Roads,","I have come three thousand miles, anxious and watchful,","Through pale snow-patches in the jagged nightmountains  --","A stranger with a lonely lantern shaken in the wind.","...Separation from my kin","Binds me closer to my servants --","Yet how I dread, so far adrift,","New Year's Day, tomorrow morning!"],t.s)
