B.anr=s(["Line after line has flown back over the border.","Where are you headed all by yourself?","In the evening rain you call to them --","And slowly you alight on an icy pond.","The low wet clouds move faster than you","Along the wall toward the cold moon.","...If they caught you in a net or with a shot,","Would it be worse than flying alone?"],t.s)
