B.ars=s(["My heart sank when I headed north from Yan Country","To the camps of China echoing ith bugle and drum.","...In an endless cold light of massive snow,","Tall flags on three borders rise up like a dawn.","War-torches invade the barbarian moonlight,","Mountain-clouds like chairmen bear the Great Wall from the sea.","...Though no youthful clerk meant to be a great general,I throw aside my writing-brush --","Like the student who tossed off cap for a lariat, I challenge what may come."],t.s)
