B.SO=s(["The travellers' parting-song sounds in the dawn.","Last night a first frost came over the river;","And the crying of the wildgeese grieves my sad heart","Bounded by a gloom of cloudy mountains....","Here in the Gate City, day will flush cold","And washing-flails quicken by the gardens at twilight  --","How long shall the capital content you,","Where the months and the years so vainly go by?"],t.s)
