B.Wg=s(["Cock-crow, the Purple Road cold in the dawn;","Linnet songs, court roofs tinted with April;","At the Golden Gate morning bell, countless doors open,","And up the jade steps float a thousand officials","With flowery scabbards.... Stars have gone down;","Willows are brushing the dew from the flags --","And, alone on the Lake of the Phoenix, a guest ","Is chanting too well The Song of Bright Spring."],t.s)
