B.Xx=s(["Round a turn of the Qin Fortress winds the Wei River,","And Yellow Mountain foot-hills enclose the Court of China;","Past the South Gate willows comes the Car of Many Bells","On the upper Palace-Garden Road-a solid length of blossom;","A Forbidden City roof holds two phoenixes in cloud;","The foliage of spring shelters multitudes from rain;","And now, when the heavens are propitious for action,","Here is our Emperor ready-no wasteful wanderer."],t.s)
