B.anK=s(["The woods have stored the rain, and slow comes the smoke","As rice is cooked on faggots and carried to the fields;","Over the quiet marsh-land flies a white egret,","And mango-birds are singing in the full summer trees....","I have learned to watch in peace the mountain morningglories,","To eat split dewy sunflower-seeds under a bough of pine,","To yield the post of honour to any boor at all....","Why should I frighten sea gulls, even with a thought?"],t.s)
