B.ao4=s(["High beyond the thick wall a tower shines with sunset","Where peach and plum are blooming and the willowcotton flies.","You have heard in your office the court-bell of twilight;","Birds find perches, officials head for home.","Your morning-jade will tinkle as you thread the golden palace;","You will bring the word of Heaven from the closing gates at night.","And I should serve there with you; but being full of years,","I have taken off official robes and am resting from my troubles."],t.s)
