B.R7=s(["Where is the temple of the famous Premier? --","In a deep pine grove near the City of Silk,","With the green grass of spring colouring the steps,","And birds chirping happily under the leaves.","...The third summons weighted him with affairs of state","And to two generations he gave his true heart,","But before he could conquer, he was dead;","And heroes have wept on their coats ever since."],t.s)
