B.O8=s(["North of me, south of me, spring is in flood,","Day after day I have seen only gulls....","My path is full of petals -- I have swept it for no others.","My thatch gate has been closed -- but opens now for you.","It's a long way to the market, I can offer you little  --","Yet here in my cottage there is old wine for our cups.","Shall we summon my elderly neighbour to join us,","Call him through the fence, and pour the jar dry?"],t.s)
