B.aiq=s(["News at this far western station! The north has been recaptured!","At first I cannot check the tears from pouring on my coat --","Where is my wife? Where are my sons?","Yet crazily sure of finding them, I pack my books and poems--","And loud my song and deep my drink","On the green spring-day that starts me home,","Back from this mountain, past another mountain,","Up from the south, north again-to my own town!"],t.s)
