B.a6L=s(["The autumn night is clear and cold in the lakka-trees of this courtyard.","I am lying forlorn in the river-town. I watch my guttering candle.","I hear the lonely notes of a bugle sounding through the dark.","The moon is in mid-heaven, but there's no one to share it with me.","My messengers are scattered by whirls of rain and sand.","City-gates are closed to a traveller; mountains are walls in my way --","Yet, I who have borne ten years of pitiable existence,","Find here a perch, a little branch, and am safe for this one night."],t.s)
