B.X4=s(["While winter daylight shortens in the elemental scale","And snow and frost whiten the cold-circling night,","Stark sounds the fifth-watch with a challenge of drum and bugle.","...The stars and the River of Heaven pulse over the three mountains;","I hear women in the distance, wailing after the battle;","I see barbarian fishermen and woodcutters in the dawn.","...Sleeping-Dragon, Plunging-Horse, are no generals now, they are dust --","Hush for a moment, O tumult of the world."],t.s)
