B.Sx=s(['"Decay and decline": deep knowledge have I of Sung Yu\'s grief.',"Romantic and refined, he too is my teacher.","Sadly looking across a thousand autumns, one shower of tears,","Melancholy in different epochs, not at the same time.","Among rivers and mountains his old abode -- empty his writings;","Deserted terrace of cloud and rain -- surely not just imagined in a dream?","Utterly the palaces of Chu are all destroyed and ruined,","The fishermen pointing them out today are unsure."],t.s)
