B.a8X=s(["Zhuge's prestige transcends the earth;","There is only reverence for his face;","Yet his will, among the Three Kingdoms at war,","Was only as one feather against a flaming sky.","He was brother of men like Yi and Lu","And in time would have surpassed the greatest of all statesmen.","Though he knew there was no hope for the House of Han,","Yet he wielded his mind for it, yielded his life."],t.s)
