B.Qn=s(["Dare I, at my age, accept my summons,","Knowing of the world's ways only wine and song?....","Over the moon-edged river come wildgeese from the Tartars;","And the thinner the leaves along the Huai, the wider the southern mountains....","I ought to be glad to take my old bones back to the capital,","But what am I good for in that world, with my few white hairs?....","As bent and decrepit as you are, I am ashamed to thank you,","When you caution me that I may encounter thunderbolts."],t.s)
