B.Og=s(["Here, where you spent your three years' exile,","To be mourned in Chu ten thousand years,","Can I trace your footprint in the autumn grass --","Or only slanting sunlight through the bleak woods?","If even good Emperor Wen was cold-hearted,","Could you hope that the dull river Xiang would understand you,","These desolate waters, these taciturn mountains,","When you came, like me, so far away?"],t.s)
