B.a_b=s(["Finch-notes and swallow-notes tell the new year....","But so far are the Town of the Horse and the Dragon Mound","From this our house, from these walls and Han Gardens,","That the moon takes my heart to the Tartar sky.","I have woven in the frame endless words of my grieving....","Yet this petal-bough is smiling now on my lonely sleep.","Oh, ask General Dou when his flags will come home","And his triumph be carved on the rock of Yanran mountain!"],t.s)
