B.a8j=s(["O youngest, best-loved daughter of Xie,","Who unluckily married this penniless scholar,","You patched my clothes from your own wicker basket,","And I coaxed off your hairpins of gold, to buy wine with;","For dinner we had to pick wild herbs --","And to use dry locust-leaves for our kindling.","...Today they are paying me a hundred thousand --","And all that I can bring to you is a temple sacrifice."],t.s)
