B.Rd=s(["We joked, long ago, about one of us dying,","But suddenly, before my eyes, you are gone.","Almost all your clothes have been given away;","Your needlework is sealed, I dare not look at it....","I continue your bounty to our men and our maids --","Sometimes, in a dream, I bring you gifts.","...This is a sorrow that all mankind must know --","But not as those know it who have been poor together."],t.s)
