B.R3=s(["I wonder why my inlaid harp has fifty strings,","Each with its flower-like fret an interval of youth.","...The sage Chuangzi is day-dreaming, bewitched by butterflies,","The spring-heart of Emperor Wang is crying in a cuckoo,","Mermen weep their pearly tears down a moon-green sea,","Blue fields are breathing their jade to the sun....","And a moment that ought to have lasted for ever","Has come and gone before I knew."],t.s)
