B.a0f=s(["A misty rain comes blowing with a wind from the east,","And wheels faintly thunder beyond Hibiscus Pool.","...Round the golden-toad lock, incense is creeping;","The jade tiger tells, on its cord, of water being drawn","A great lady once, from behind a screen, favoured a poor youth;","A fairy queen brought a bridal mat once for the ease of a prince and then vanished.","...Must human hearts blossom in spring, like all other flowers?","And of even this bright flame of love, shall there be only ashes?"],t.s)
