B.a0i=s(["Monkeys and birds are still alert for your orders","And winds and clouds eager to shield your fortress.","...You were master of the brush, and a sagacious general,","But your Emperor, defeated, rode the prison-cart.","You were abler than even the greatest Zhou statesmen,","Yet less fortunate than the two Shu generals who were killed in action.","And, though at your birth-place a temple has been built to you,","You never finished singing your Song of the Holy Mountain"],t.s)
