B.aqx=s(["Time was long before I met her, but is longer since we parted,","And the east wind has arisen and a hundred flowers are gone,","And the silk-worms of spring will weave until they die","And every night the candles will weep their wicks away.","Mornings in her mirror she sees her hair-cloud changing,","Yet she dares the chill of moonlight with her evening song.","...It is not so very far to her Enchanted Mountain","O blue-birds, be listening!-Bring me what she says!"],t.s)
