B.Oq=s(["A faint phoenix-tail gauze, fragrant and doubled,","Lines your green canopy, closed for the night....","Will your shy face peer round a moon-shaped fan,","And your voice be heard hushing the rattle of my carriage?","It is quiet and quiet where your gold lamp dies,","How far can a pomegranate-blossom whisper?","...I will tether my horse to a river willow","And wait for the will of the southwest wind."],t.s)
