B.ZF=s(["There are many curtains in your care-free house,","Where rapture lasts the whole night long.","...What are the lives of angels but dreams","If they take no lovers into their rooms?","...Storms are ravishing the nut-horns,","Moon-dew sweetening cinnamon-leaves","I know well enough naught can come of this union,","Yet how it serves to ease my heart!"],t.s)
