B.akc=s(["The sun has set in the water's clear void,","And little blue islands are one with the sky.","On the bank a horse neighs. A boat goes by.","People gather at a willow-clump and wait for the ferry.","Down by the sand-bushes sea-gulls are circling,","Over the wide river-lands flies  an egret.","...Can you guess why I sail, like an ancient wise lover,","Through the misty Five Lakes, forgetting words?"],t.s)
