B.aan=s(["Though our envoy, Su Wu, is gone, body and soul,","This temple survives, these trees endure....","Wildgeese through the clouds are still calling to the moon there","And hill-sheep unshepherded graze along the border.","...Returning, he found his country changed","Since with youthful cap and sword he had left it.","His bitter adventures had won him no title....","Autumn-waves endlessly sob in the river."],t.s)
