B.afL=s(["Haw, haw, haw, haw, haw, haw, haw, haw, haw, haw, haw, haw, haw,","Mulan is woven at home.","Without hearing the sound of the loom,","I only heard the woman sigh.","Ask the woman what she thinks,","Ask the woman what she remembers.","The woman was also lost in thought,","Women also have no memories.","Last night I saw a military post,","Khan's Great Troops,","Twelve volumes of military books,","The scroll has a grandfather's name.","My grandpa has no eldest son, ","and Mulan has no elder brother. ","I would like to be the Pommeled Horse of the city ","and levy for you from now on.","Buying a Steed in Dongshi,","Buying saddles in the West Market,","Buy a bridle in Nanshi,","Buy a long whip in Beishi.","After bidding farewell to my parents,","Staying by the Yellow River at dusk,",u.I,"But I heard the sound and splashing of the Yellow River flowing water.","As I bid farewell to the Yellow River,","At dusk, at the head of Heishan Mountain,",u.I,"But I heard the sound of Yanshan Hu riding and chirping.","Traveling thousands of miles to the military,","Guanshan Du is like flying.","Shuo Qi transmits the golden watchtower,","The cold light shines on the iron coat.","The general died in countless battles,","The hero returned in ten years.","Returning to meet the emperor,","The emperor sits in the bright hall.","Ce Xun's Twelve Revolutions,","Reward over a hundred thousand.","Khan asked what he wanted,","Mulan doesn't need a Shangshulang,","May I travel a thousand miles,","Send my child back to his hometown.","Ye Niang heard the girl coming,","Departing from Guo to support the general;","Sister, upon hearing her arrival,","Apply red makeup to the household;","Little brother, upon hearing my sister's arrival,","Sharpen the knife vigorously towards pigs and sheep.","Open the door of my East Pavilion,","Sitting on my West Pavilion bed,","Take off my wartime robe,","Wearing my old clothes.","When the window trims the temples,","Mirror sticker flower yellow.","When I went out to see my companions, ","they were all surprised : ","I had been with them for twelve years, ","but I didn't know Mulan was a girl.","The male rabbit's feet pounce on the Shuo,","Female rabbit eyes blurred;","Two rabbits walking on the ground,","Can you tell if I am a male or female?"],t.s)
