B.an2=s(["Mutou Shihao Village,","Officials catch people at night.","The old man walked over the wall,","The old woman went out to see.","The official exclaimed in anger,","Why do women cry so hard.","Listening to the woman's speech,","Three men guarding the city of Ye.","A man attached a letter to,","The second man died in battle.","Survivors and illegitimate beings,","The deceased has already passed away.","There is no one in the room,","Only have a baby grandson.","My grandmother has not gone yet,","The entrance and exit are endless skirts.","The old woman's strength may decline,","Please return from the official's office at night.","Urgently responding to the Battle of Heyang,","Still need to prepare for morning cooking.","After a long night, my voice fell silent,","As if sobbing and swallowing.","Tianming ascends to the future,","Farewell to the old man alone."],t.s)
