B.akE=s(["In August and autumn, the high winds howl fiercely,","Roll up the triple thatch on my house.","Mao Fei crossed the river and scattered the suburbs,","The tall one hangs on the long treetops of the forest,","The lower part drifts and sinks into the pond.","The children in the southern village bully me, old and powerless,","Ninneng faces the thief,","Openly embrace the thatch and go into the bamboo.","Lips burning and mouth dry, unable to breathe,","Returning with a cane, I sighed.","The Russian breeze settles the clouds in ink,","Autumn turns from desert to darkness.","The blanket has been cold like iron for many years,","Jiao'er's evil lies and steps inside, cracking.","The bedside room has no dry spots,","The rain's feet remain as numb as hemp.","Due to menstrual disorders and lack of sleep,","Why do you get wet in the long night?","Ande Guangsha has millions of rooms,","All the poor people in the world are delighted to be sheltered,","The wind and rain remain as still as mountains.","Woo hoo!","When did I suddenly see this house in front of me,","It's enough for me to break through and freeze to death alone in Wulu!"],t.s)
