B.a_j=s(["Have you not seen me walking by the snowy seaside in Machuan,","The flat sand, vast expanse, and yellow enter the sky.","In September, the wind roars at night,","A river of gravel is as big as a bucket,","Strolling on the ground with stones in the wind.","The Xiongnu grass is yellow and the horse is plump,","To the west of Jinshan, smoke and dust fly,","The great general of the Han family departed from the west.","The general's golden armor never falls off at night,","In the middle of the night, the army marched and fought against each other,","The wind is as sharp as a blade.","Horse hair steamed with snow and sweat,","Five flowers with money spinning into ice,","In the curtain, grass calls and inkstone water condenses.","Upon hearing this, the Lu cavalry responded with courage and deterrence,","Unexpectedly, short soldiers dare not take over,","Che Shi stands at the west gate offering victory."],t.s)
