B.Uf=s(["In the cold autumn of independence,","To the north of the Xiangjiang River,","Orange Island Head.","Watching thousands of mountains turn red,","All the layers of forest are dyed;","The river is clear and transparent,","Hundred boats compete for excellence.","Eagle strikes the sky,","Fish soar on the shallow bottom,","All kinds of frost compete for freedom.","Feeling desolate and desolate,","Ask the vast earth,","Who controls the ups and downs?","Bring a hundred couples for a trip,","Recalling the turbulent times of the past.","Just like a young classmate,","In its prime;","Scholarly spirit,","Be bold and powerful.","Guide the country,","Encouraging words,","The feces and soil were once a thousand feudal lords.","Have you ever remembered,","To hit the water at mid flow,","Waves stop flying boats?"],t.s)
