B.TS=s(["The peacock flies to the southeast,","Every five li it lingers.","At thirteen she could weave plain silk,","At fourteen learn to cut clothes.","At fifteen play the konghou,","At sixteen read books of poetry.","At seventeen she became your wife,","But her heart was always sad."],t.s)
