B.ajT=s(["I am a descendant of the high Yang,","My noble father was named Boyong.","When the Sheti star was in Zhen, in the first month,","On a Gengyin day I was born.","My father saw my nativity,","And gave me an auspicious name.","My given name is Zhengze,","My style is Lingjun."],t.s)
