B.Qx=s(["On and on the road, on and on,","I am parted from you in life.","We are ten thousand li apart,","Each at the end of heaven.","The road is blocked and long,","When can we meet again?","Northern horses turn to the north wind,","Southern birds nest on southern branches."],t.s)
